msgid "The control panel's recent calls, of this boot and the one before: when, which page call or AT command, how long it took and how it ended (ok, error, busy, killed). No values, replies or messages are kept. Useful when the panel was stuck."
msgstr "Panggilan terbaru panel kontrol, dari boot ini dan sebelumnya: kapan, panggilan halaman atau perintah AT apa, berapa lama, dan bagaimana berakhirnya (ok, galat, sibuk, dihentikan). Tidak ada nilai, balasan, atau pesan yang disimpan. Berguna saat panel macet."

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "Tidak tersedia"

msgid "USB network mode is unavailable in host mode; host auto-start also disables USB network auto-start."
msgstr "Mode jaringan USB tidak tersedia dalam mode host; mulai otomatis host juga menonaktifkan mulai otomatis jaringan USB."

msgid "Host mode immediately disconnects USB management. F50 has no battery and peripherals may need external power; make sure another management path exists."
msgstr "Mode host langsung memutus manajemen USB. F50 tidak memiliki baterai dan periferal mungkin memerlukan daya eksternal; pastikan ada jalur manajemen lain."

msgid "USB networking and serial will re-enumerate in device mode."
msgstr "Jaringan USB dan serial akan dienumerasi ulang dalam mode perangkat."

